                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Draper to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-02-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 3,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Consular visé on pork-meats certificates abolished from January 28.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Draper.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
